> >>+                    !__TYPE_IS_UL(t) && !__TYPE_IS_PTR(t) &&           \
> >>+                    !__TYPE_IS_LOFFT(t));                              \
> >
> >I think it's wrong, as loff_t is 64-bit in 32-bit userspace, and this
> >will clear meaningful data in top halve.
